A realistic plugin for Minecraft Servers

Features:
    ServerBank
        Setup initial economy, thas make that no money can be created if the bank no has money
    EconomySystem


Dependencies:
    Vault for standars API Methods


Commands:

    eco setup cuantity (This must be only setup at the beginig of the economy, if dont want fuck it. Only runs by the console.)

    eco balance
    eco balance player
    eco add player amount (The money will be taken from the bank if is available)
    eco take player amount (The money will be deposited to the bank)
    eco pay player amount (Player will pay to player if has money)


Api Usage


    if (getServer().getPluginManager().getPlugin("RealisticEconomy") != null) {
        RealisticEconomy economyPlugin = getServer().getPluginManager().getPlugin("RealisticEconomy");
        ServerBank = economyPlugin.getServerBank();
        EconomyService eco = economyPlugin.getEconomyService();
    }

Then you can get all Methods availables